\par\par \b \uc2 Business News: \uc2 UPS\uc2  and \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  To Resume Negotiations\b0\par\par\uc2 By Esther Fung \par \uc2 275 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 July 2023\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B3\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 United Parcel Service\uc2  and the \uc2 International Brotherhood of Teamsters\uc2  said they would resume negotiations on a new labor contract next week, the final week before roughly 330,000 workers could go on strike.\par \par \uc2 If the two sides can't reach an agreement by midnight July 31, \uc2 UPS\uc2  drivers and package sorters will be able to go on strike starting Tuesday, Aug. 1. \uc2 UPS\uc2  pilots, who have a different contract, have pledged to honor the picket line.\par \par \uc2 UPS\uc2  said Wednesday it is prepared to increase its pay and benefits to complete a deal. The \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  said the company had reached out to resume negotiations. The talks stalled earlier this month.\par \par \uc2 A major sticking point is pay for part-time workers, which account for roughly half of the \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  workers represented by the current negotiations. The \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  are seeking starting pay for part-time workers north of $20 an hour. Currently, the minimum part-time hourly pay starts at $16.20, and could be higher in places where there is more competition for labor. \uc2 UPS\uc2  said union-represented part-time workers make on average $20 an hour after 30 days.\par \par \uc2 The union says there is high turnover among part-time workers in part because of the low pay, and the majority of part-timers want full-time positions. \uc2 UPS\uc2  said 38,000 part-time employees advanced to full-time positions between 2018 and 2022.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  and \uc2 UPS\uc2  made inroads on other issues, including the company agreeing to eliminate its two-tier system for drivers. The union said this classification allowed \uc2 UPS\uc2  to pay some drivers lower wages.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020230720ej7k0000y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
